# Visual baselines are generated in CI (Linux). Font rasterisation differs per
# platform, so a snapshot taken on Windows fails on the runner and vice versa.
# Only the Linux baselines are committed; see docs/ARCHITECTURE.md.
**/*-darwin.png
**/*-win32.png
